@format 1
@id ui-event.9080cb76bd917653
@title List clear change
@section I. UI
@area UI event
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge, Funnel
@event-ref cs|PMainArea/PTabSurface.cs|PTabViewerAttach|pList|PListClearChange|1
@entry input
@summary When removed paths include the loaded media, force-close the viewer and clear that tab's flow even if the tab is inactive.
@tag clear change
@tag PTabSurface
@alias owner = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PTabSurface
@alias viewer = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PViewer
@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow

[input] List paths removed <input>
- Receive the removed paths through the handler registered by the tab surface @ owner.PTabViewerAttach
> route

[route] Was the loaded path removed? <decision>
- Compare the viewer source path with every removed path, ignoring case @ owner.PTabViewerAttach
? "Loaded path was not removed" > unchanged
? "Loaded path was removed" > clear

[clear] Clear media-dependent tab state <process>
- Force-close viewer and player state regardless of viewer command activation @ viewer.PViewerMediaClose
- Directly clear flow source, sections, keyframes, waveform, cursor, and selection @ flow.PFlowClear
> output

[output] Removed media cleared <output>
= The removed loaded media no longer remains in Preview or the tab-owned flow.
! Code binding: cs|PMainArea/PTabSurface.cs|PTabViewerAttach|pList|PListClearChange|1

[unchanged] Unrelated removal <output>
= The viewer and flow remain attached to their still-listed media.
! Code binding: cs|PMainArea/PTabSurface.cs|PTabViewerAttach|pList|PListClearChange|1
